<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fuller said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fuller said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities raised its rating on H.B. Fuller Co to long-term outperform from underperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said EVEREN raised its 1996 earnings per share view on H.B. Fuller to $2.55 from $2.21 and its 1997 EPS view to $2.90 from $2.55.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
